<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <body style="font-family: sans-serif; color: #1a1a1a;">
    <p>Welcome to {{ app_name }}, <strong>{{ display_name }}</strong>.</p>
    <p>Confirm this address to finish setting up your account:</p>
    <p>
      <a href="{{ verify_url }}"
         style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 20px; background: #1d4ed8;
                color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px;">
        Confirm my email
      </a>
    </p>
    <p style="color: #666666; font-size: 12px;">
      This link expires in {{ expires_hours }} hours.
    </p>
    <p style="color: #666666; font-size: 12px;">
      Until it is confirmed you can still use {{ app_name }} normally — you just
      won't be able to send trip invites, or receive one someone sends to
      this address.
    </p>
    <p style="color: #666666; font-size: 12px;">
      If you didn't create a {{ app_name }} account, you can ignore this email.
    </p>
  </body>
</html>
